        ],
        "description": "<p>Choose the role you grew into — all three are street-taught, with no corp academy: <strong>Drone Jockey</strong> (a swarm of small deployables), <strong>Vehicle Rig-Pilot</strong> (one big platform you Jump into), or <strong>Facility Rigger</strong> (a building turned into a weapon). Each grants a skill and its own ability ladder. (<em>Quick Build:</em> Drone Jockey.)</p><p>Your subclass determines your heroic abilities: you choose from its Base Tier at 1st level, its 7-cost band (or Focus Fire) at 3rd, its 9-cost band at 5th, and its 11-cost band at 8th.</p>",
